    "sourceWikitext": "{{recipesummary|category=Beef recipes|servings=6|difficulty=3|Image=[[Image:Korean.food-Bulgogi-01.jpg|300px]]}}\n\n{{recipe}}| [[Cookbook:Cuisine of Korea|Korean Cuisine]] \n\n==Ingredients==\n*1 [[Cookbook:Pound|lb]] (450 [[Cookbook:Gram|g]]) [[Cookbook:Beef|beef]] suitable for grilling, [[Cookbook:Slicing|sliced]] as thin as possible\n*3 [[Cookbook:Green onion|green onions]], sliced on the bias\n*4 button [[Cookbook:Mushroom|mushrooms]] (optional), sliced\n*½ [[Cookbook:Onion|onion]] (optional), thinly sliced\n*¾ [[Cookbook:Cup|cup]] [[Cookbook:Soy Sauce|soy sauce]]\n*¼ cup white granulated [[Cookbook:Sugar|sugar]]\n*¼ cup (4 [[Cookbook:Tablespoon|tbsp]]) [[Cookbook:Sesame Oil|sesame oil]]\n*4 [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|tsp]] [[Cookbook:Pepper|pepper]]\n*1–2 tbsp [[Cookbook:Mincing|minced]] [[Cookbook:Garlic|garlic]]\n*1 tbsp [[Cookbook:Mirin|mirin]] (optional)\n\n==Procedure==\n#Combine all the ingredients in a big bowl. [[Cookbook:Marinating|Marinate]] for at least 30 minutes, but marinating overnight will get the best flavor and tenderization.\n#[[Cookbook:Grilling|Grill]] the beef.\n#Serve with rice.\n\n==Notes, tips, and variations==\n*Use same amount of soy sauce and sugar.\n*If you do this a day ahead, reduce the amount of soy sauce and don't forget to put it in a refrigerator.\n*Use thinly-sliced beef, available specifically for Bulgogi in some grocery stores, for best results.\n*You can grill this on a table top, with a shallow pan. You can also use just a normal fry pan.\n*Grill over medium-high heat and have the juice of beef and vegetables on rice.\n*You may marinate the beef in [[Cookbook:Cola|cola]] (Coca-Cola works best) instead of using just sugar. The extra liquid helps the meat to absorb the marinade more quickly.\n*You can also add 1 finely-chopped or [[Cookbook:Grater|grated]] [[Cookbook:Asian Pear|Korean pear]] to your marinade overnight in lieu of sugar or cola. This will help tenderize the meat. \n\n\n[[Category:Recipes using beef|Bulgogi]]\n[[Category:Korean recipes|Bulgogi]]\n[[Category:Grilled recipes]]\n[[Category:Main course recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes with metric units]]\n[[Category:Recipes using granulated sugar]]\n[[Category:Recipes using mirin]]\n[[Category:Recipes using common mushroom]]",
    "isRecipe": true,
